#menumanager 6 41 30

// Menu Box : Screen width (x), screen height (y), window top (y), window left (x), window bottom (y), window right (x)
// Note 1: The default radio menu font in otwfonts.dat assumes a box width of 310, height 250 (certified from 100% up to 150% max Windows10 scale font size -> DPI ). With top edge margin of 130 pixels and a right edge margin of 10 pixel.
// Note 2: The list HAS to be sorted by screen HEIGHT 1st, then WIDTH 2nd!
// Note 3: Specifically for large ("4K" screens), if you want to move the window closer to the center of the screen, adjust the "window left (x)" and "window right (x)" as desired (by the same amount of pixels for both values).
// Note 4: If you want to add a resolution, increase the last number in the "menumanager" line to match the number of resolution lines.

