#menu TankerMsg AiNoExtent 2 0 white OTHER AGENCIES COMMANDS
// Important Note:
// To differentiate in the code to know which agency to send the message towards -
// the first word of the menu page names under the OTHER AGENCIES COMMANDS section 
// selects the agency to which the messages are sent.
// "Tanker" and "JTAC" [for FAC messages] (case sensitive) are the two such agency 
// names supported for now. They are hardcoded. DON'T CHANGE THE NAMES!

